      "text": "\ud83c\udfc6 **Treasure found!** \n\nHere's the path that led to victory:\n1. Started at the stone gate, moved **north** into the courtyard.\n2. Searched the courtyard and found a **torn map fragment** hinting at the fountain.\n3. Explored **east** into the tangled garden and found a **rusty key** under a bush.\n4. Returned **west**, then **north** \u2014 the key unlocked the tower door.\n5. Climbed **up** the ladder (after a loose rung sent me back down once) into the attic.\n6. Searched the attic and pried open a dusty chest \u2014 **found the treasure!** \ud83c\udf89"
